\cf0 In this magical survival game, you guide a brave little hero through waves of mysterious creatures that appear from every side. Move carefully, gather level, choose upgrades, and turn each run into a stronger build than the last.\
Unlock and switch between different characters, each with their own feeling in battle. Pick weapons that change how you fight, then combine them with buffs to create powerful strategies. Some runs may become fast and aggressive, while others can focus on defense, range, magic, or crowd control.\
But the deeper you survive, the more dangerous the night becomes. Stronger enemies will surround you, and mighty bosses will appear to test everything you have built.\
